{
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "来挑个东西吧，奇妙的小动物！今天是独自来这里的吗？",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "你不喜欢那个眼球？我能理解，任谁盯着它都会感觉晕乎乎的！",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "你也有自己的收藏啊！要不要和我做个交易？",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "如果这能帮我战胜建筑师，我乐意交换。",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-2.ancient": "当然！这就给你挑几样上好的装备！",

  "NEOW.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "[sine]...主动.. 找我么？ ..很好...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...你 ..比我想的 ...有用.. ...但不够....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.char": "他仍然无比强大。降下祝福吧。",
  "NEOW.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.ancient": "[sine]...你.. 还缺... ..什么...？[/sine]",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "在高塔的生灵中，你算是干净的了。过来吧，让我把你变得光彩夺目。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.char": "我见过被你赐福的生物，但它攻击了我。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2.ancient": "你应当庆幸遇到我的护卫，而不是别的东西，不是么？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "伟大而忠诚的骑士啊！我将为你赐福。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "身为来自外界的傀儡，你却没有传颂我的名字。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "希望我不用这么做。[i][font_size=22]如果你看到了，请报告给作者。[/font_size][/i]",

  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "蛇！！长袍下面是什么？",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.char": "是带给建筑师的礼物。",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2.ancient": "再带点东西吧！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "这里的东西！这里曾经没有的东西！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.char": "……你知道这些是什么，还在等我？",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.ancient": "建筑师能帮你！给你更多亮闪闪的礼物！！",

  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]父亲还好么……？[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.char": "你父亲健在。我们的轮回恐怕是徒劳的。",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]劝说你不是我该做的……拿走我的一部分吧。[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.char": "[i][font_size=22]蛇选择不去惊醒佩尔。[/font_size][/i]",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你应该放下你的执念。[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "你还是劝了。这次要写什么？",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]不必了。刻下的字很快就会融化，父亲也从来不看……[/thinky_dots]",

  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "[b]好强大的武器！但你太小了，怎么用它！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "[b]不是武器的东西，你带了太多！脱下那块布再战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "[b]蛇，与我一战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "战斗",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]蛇与坦克斯战斗了。[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-2.ancient": "[b]这些都是武器！？那你一定需要更多！！[/b]",

  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "快进来吧，安静的小家伙！这么快就又见到你，你一定累坏了吧。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.char": "感谢关心，您认错了。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2.ancient": "哦！不是那个女孩么？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "啊呀呀，快过来暖和一下吧！你都快在外面冻硬了呀。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "真是坚持不懈呀，可爱的小家伙！这次也来让我帮帮你啦？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]蛇蹭了蹭特兹卡塔拉。[/font_size][/i]",

  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.ancient": "真是完美的傀儡啊。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.char": "我只需要攻击建筑师的力量，请不要误会。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2.ancient": "你甚至自愿记住这一切啊！[i][font_size=22]瓦库大笑起来。[/font_size][/i]",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "建筑师还不够，把那个幽灵也杀了吧！",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.ancient": "把这一份也签了吧。我为你特别准备了这个，你可是满足成为我傀儡的一切需求。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.char": "我不是为你而来的。而且那上面什么都没写，对吧？",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-2.ancient": "即使我友善的玩笑都要无情拆穿么？这让你越来越讨喜了。",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0r.ancient": "是饥不择食的野兽么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1r.char": "有人比我更渴望你。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-2r.ancient": "还不如饥饿所驱。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.0-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.ancient": "是静默猎手的武器么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-1r.char": "我们都不用装作无知。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-2r.ancient": "我知道，[green]猎物[/green]。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.1-attack": "Both",

  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0r.ancient": "是涅奥做的吧？杀死她也能达成你的目的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SNAKE_IN_SPIRE_EXTEND_CHARACTER_SNAKE.2-1r.char": "那疯子还会来找你，并一去不返。我也一样。",
